{
  "id": "p03",
  "title": "The Wet Camp",
  "titleZh": "雨中的营地",
  "topic": "校园",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My school trip starts on a wet Monday morning in late May.",
        "zh": "我的学校旅行在一个潮湿的五月周一早上开始。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our teacher writes tion on the board and says: attention, please.",
        "zh": "老师在黑板上写下 tion，说：请注意。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young girl brings similar old words up to the front board.",
        "zh": "一个年轻女孩把几个相似的旧词带到前面的板子上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Here the whole class reads them aloud as one happy, noisy team.",
        "zh": "全班在这里把它们大声读出来，像一个开心的、吵闹的小队。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Perhaps we shall finish the whole programme before the old bus leaves.",
        "zh": "也许我们会在旧巴士开走前把整个节目演完。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Each small job on the paper list is available to almost anyone.",
        "zh": "纸单上的每一份小工作几乎谁都能做。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The bus takes us near a huge airport beside the grey sea.",
        "zh": "公交车把我们带到灰色海边一个巨大机场的附近。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Cold rain falls on an empty path and makes the ground soft.",
        "zh": "冷雨落在空荡的小路上，把地面弄得松软。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We walk a bit slowly and nod to the silent tent owner.",
        "zh": "我们慢慢走了一点，朝沉默的帐篷主人点了点头。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My mother packs a warm coat and a small lamp for me.",
        "zh": "我母亲给我装了一件暖外套和一盏小灯。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A single dollar buys warm sweets at the little camp shop.",
        "zh": "一美元就能在营地小店里买到热乎的糖果。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Yesterday fear kept two small girls inside the cold, shaky tent.",
        "zh": "昨天，恐惧让两个小女孩留在了又冷又晃的帐篷里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Whose small foot left this long dark mark by the wooden door?",
        "zh": "是谁的小脚在木门边留下这道长长的黑印？"
      },
      {
        "en": "They find their own way and pitch the heavy tent themselves.",
        "zh": "他们自己找到路，亲手把沉重的帐篷搭起来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An army truck waits beside the grey ship at the shore.",
        "zh": "一辆军车停在岸边那艘灰船旁边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A little blood on its wing shows no disease at all.",
        "zh": "它翅膀上有一点血，却看不出任何疾病。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The bird is alive, so we wrap it in a soft cloth.",
        "zh": "这只鸟还活着，于是我们用一块软布把它裹起来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then our slow progress serves one clear purpose: a dry, safe tent.",
        "zh": "后来，我们缓慢的进展服务着一个明确目的：一顶干燥、安全的帐篷。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We cannot cook unless the old lamp gives enough light.",
        "zh": "除非那盏旧灯能给出足够的光，否则我们没法做饭。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A birthday box holds dark chocolate and a few sweet nuts.",
        "zh": "一个生日盒子里装着黑巧克力和几颗甜坚果。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One pleasant smell drifts slowly from the small kitchen tent.",
        "zh": "一股好闻的味道从厨房小帐篷里缓缓飘出来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An old servant keeps a habit: singing very softly at night.",
        "zh": "一位老仆人有个习惯：夜里很轻地唱歌。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later we regret nothing at all; fixing the tent was a coup.",
        "zh": "后来我们一点也不后悔；把帐篷修好是一记妙招。"
      },
      {
        "en": "This dangerous storm surprises the whole wide world tonight.",
        "zh": "这场危险的风暴今晚惊动了整个世界。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We have a good supply of dry wood and clean water.",
        "zh": "我们有一批充足的干柴和干净的水。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the winner gets a dry tent and the bright camp flag.",
        "zh": "接着，获胜者得到一顶干帐篷和那面鲜亮的营地旗。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We shall bring this good habit back to our town.",
        "zh": "我们会把这个好习惯带回我们的镇子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My mother will hear of our small coup and smile with pride.",
        "zh": "我母亲听到我们这记小妙招，会带着骄傲笑起来。"
      }
    ]
  ],
